  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你知道人生最大的危险是什么吗，不是坏人太坏，而是蠢人太蠢，保命最重要的就是远离蠢人，因为蠢人是不可能善良的，他连善恶都分不清楚，知识越匮乏，认知越低的人，想法越绝对，诸君，你身边有这种人吗？#治愈力 #情商 #成长 #读书",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_34a16819ec77feb4_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 194.769002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "究君，你知道人生最大的危险是什么吗？不是坏人太坏，而是蠢人太蠢、保命。最重要的就是远离蠢人，因为蠢人是不可能善良的，他连善恶都分不清楚。你说的每一句话他都会反驳，而且喜欢用小概率的个案来反驳你常规的事实。就比如你说吸烟有害健康，他说不可能。我爷爷抽烟喝酒活到九十五，你劝他好好学习读书提升学历，他会觉得你是看不起他。反驳说，你你你看人家小学毕业的，照样还是大老板硕士毕业出来，还是得送外卖。这种认知越匮乏，认知越低的人，想法越绝对。朱军，你身边有这种人吗？蠢人都有个特点，谁跟他越亲，他就越防备，谁谁对他越好，他就越折磨谁。他可以相信全世界的骗子，却偏偏怀疑最爱他的人一个蠢人能够造成的伤害比坏人还要多。坏人他还会承担后果，但蠢人做蠢事却要别人来背锅。愚蠢是一种道德上的缺陷，蠢就是坏，这不是刻薄，也不是居高临下的傲慢。世界上最危险的恶，就是这种无知之恶。我自己做新媒体以来发现，互联网最大的危险并不是让无知的人变多了，而是让无知的人找到了彼此，形成傻子共振的信息。检房，坏人处心积虑不如蠢人，灵机一动。比如有个女生，她的重要的档案寄回家里面千叮咛万嘱咐，父母千万不能拆开来，结果回家发现还是被她母亲给拆开了。但她并没有反思自己的行为，反而怪孩子脾气太大，自己只是好心帮忙，看看，不至于有什么严重的后果。而这种拒绝思考，只按照自己想法行动的行为，在心理学中就是一种以自我为中心的认知惰性，他们没有接受差异化、多元化的能力。只要是他们没见过的，没听过的，或者但凡和他已有的认知不一致的，他们通通会无差别的攻击和否认。他们很难接受新鲜事物认知，非常封闭。朱军千万不要让蠢人接近自己，我接受你有不同的价值观，不同的生活方式，但真的不能蠢蠢人，最擅长道德绑架。他们不知道事物并不是非黑即白的，而是有灰色地带的蠢人，没有办法理解他人。他丧失了最基本的同理心，认知水平低的人做不了好人，因为做好人并不简单，他需要你有一定的判断力和反思能力。但我发现厌蠢的人其实赚不了大钱，为什么呢？因为赚大钱，本质上就是一场尊重笨蛋的游戏，你瞧不起谁，就赚不到谁的钱，向下兼容才是财富密码，能伺候好自己讨厌的人才是赚钱的最高境界。而有些品牌就只赚蠢人的钱，你要是鼓励一个愚蠢的人继续愚蠢，他会感激你。但是你要试图帮他走出愚蠢，他会恨你的尊重。每一只青蛙和它的景，不要去试图改变什么。每个人的认知都配得上他的苦难。唯上至与下愚不疑。诸君，你之所以受到委屈，是因为你一直在试图改变一个根本不可能改变的人。人生最大的清醒就是允许别人愚蠢，但绝不允许别人的愚蠢，毁掉自己。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 410,
      "text": "究君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 850,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "你知道人生最大的危险是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3170,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "不是坏人太坏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4650,
      "end_ms": 7110,
      "text": "而是蠢人太蠢、保命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7190,
      "end_ms": 9090,
      "text": "最重要的就是远离蠢人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9490,
      "end_ms": 11290,
      "text": "因为蠢人是不可能善良的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11370,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "他连善恶都分不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13410,
      "end_ms": 15370,
      "text": "你说的每一句话他都会反驳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15490,
      "end_ms": 19130,
      "text": "而且喜欢用小概率的个案来反驳你常规的事实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19390,
      "end_ms": 21470,
      "text": "就比如你说吸烟有害健康，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21690,
      "end_ms": 22490,
      "text": "他说不可能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22630,
      "end_ms": 24450,
      "text": "我爷爷抽烟喝酒活到九十五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24770,
      "end_ms": 27090,
      "text": "你劝他好好学习读书提升学历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27310,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "他会觉得你是看不起他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29070,
      "end_ms": 29830,
      "text": "反驳说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 29830,
      "end_ms": 31580,
      "text": "你你你看人家小学毕业的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31580,
      "end_ms": 33540,
      "text": "照样还是大老板硕士毕业出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33540,
      "end_ms": 34480,
      "text": "还是得送外卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35000,
      "end_ms": 36700,
      "text": "这种认知越匮乏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36720,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "认知越低的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 37940,
      "end_ms": 38980,
      "text": "想法越绝对。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39180,
      "end_ms": 39640,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39760,
      "end_ms": 41060,
      "text": "你身边有这种人吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 41300,
      "end_ms": 42480,
      "text": "蠢人都有个特点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 42660,
      "end_ms": 43620,
      "text": "谁跟他越亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 43760,
      "end_ms": 44700,
      "text": "他就越防备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 44700,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "谁谁对他越好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 46340,
      "end_ms": 47400,
      "text": "他就越折磨谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 49680,
      "text": "他可以相信全世界的骗子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 49740,
      "end_ms": 55300,
      "text": "却偏偏怀疑最爱他的人一个蠢人能够造成的伤害比坏人还要多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 55740,
      "end_ms": 57520,
      "text": "坏人他还会承担后果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57660,
      "end_ms": 59915,
      "text": "但蠢人做蠢事却要别人来背锅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60480,
      "end_ms": 62365,
      "text": "愚蠢是一种道德上的缺陷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 62830,
      "end_ms": 64315,
      "text": "蠢就是坏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 64790,
      "end_ms": 65630,
      "text": "这不是刻薄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65710,
      "end_ms": 67325,
      "text": "也不是居高临下的傲慢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67690,
      "end_ms": 69090,
      "text": "世界上最危险的恶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 69090,
      "end_ms": 70665,
      "text": "就是这种无知之恶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 71100,
      "end_ms": 72960,
      "text": "我自己做新媒体以来发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72960,
      "end_ms": 76395,
      "text": "互联网最大的危险并不是让无知的人变多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 76690,
      "end_ms": 78930,
      "text": "而是让无知的人找到了彼此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79150,
      "end_ms": 80770,
      "text": "形成傻子共振的信息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 80770,
      "end_ms": 81255,
      "text": "检房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 81650,
      "end_ms": 84030,
      "text": "坏人处心积虑不如蠢人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 84090,
      "end_ms": 85025,
      "text": "灵机一动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 85400,
      "end_ms": 86160,
      "text": "比如有个女生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 86300,
      "end_ms": 89520,
      "text": "她的重要的档案寄回家里面千叮咛万嘱咐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 89520,
      "end_ms": 90880,
      "text": "父母千万不能拆开来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 90980,
      "end_ms": 93320,
      "text": "结果回家发现还是被她母亲给拆开了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 93480,
      "end_ms": 95340,
      "text": "但她并没有反思自己的行为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 95360,
      "end_ms": 96895,
      "text": "反而怪孩子脾气太大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 97190,
      "end_ms": 98470,
      "text": "自己只是好心帮忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 98470,
      "end_ms": 98870,
      "text": "看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 98970,
      "end_ms": 100475,
      "text": "不至于有什么严重的后果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 100750,
      "end_ms": 102150,
      "text": "而这种拒绝思考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 102170,
      "end_ms": 104265,
      "text": "只按照自己想法行动的行为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 104540,
      "end_ms": 107695,
      "text": "在心理学中就是一种以自我为中心的认知惰性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 108130,
      "end_ms": 110930,
      "text": "他们没有接受差异化、多元化的能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 111090,
      "end_ms": 112790,
      "text": "只要是他们没见过的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 112790,
      "end_ms": 113550,
      "text": "没听过的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 113570,
      "end_ms": 116230,
      "text": "或者但凡和他已有的认知不一致的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 116250,
      "end_ms": 118875,
      "text": "他们通通会无差别的攻击和否认。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 119140,
      "end_ms": 121420,
      "text": "他们很难接受新鲜事物认知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 121420,
      "end_ms": 122355,
      "text": "非常封闭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 122740,
      "end_ms": 125375,
      "text": "朱军千万不要让蠢人接近自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 125740,
      "end_ms": 127520,
      "text": "我接受你有不同的价值观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 127540,
      "end_ms": 128580,
      "text": "不同的生活方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 128720,
      "end_ms": 130630,
      "text": "但真的不能蠢蠢人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 130630,
      "end_ms": 131985,
      "text": "最擅长道德绑架。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 132270,
      "end_ms": 134610,
      "text": "他们不知道事物并不是非黑即白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 134630,
      "end_ms": 136720,
      "text": "而是有灰色地带的蠢人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 136720,
      "end_ms": 138060,
      "text": "没有办法理解他人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 138160,
      "end_ms": 140085,
      "text": "他丧失了最基本的同理心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 140570,
      "end_ms": 142530,
      "text": "认知水平低的人做不了好人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 142670,
      "end_ms": 144010,
      "text": "因为做好人并不简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 144010,
      "end_ms": 146735,
      "text": "他需要你有一定的判断力和反思能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 147000,
      "end_ms": 149945,
      "text": "但我发现厌蠢的人其实赚不了大钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 150170,
      "end_ms": 150745,
      "text": "为什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 151000,
      "end_ms": 151940,
      "text": "因为赚大钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 151940,
      "end_ms": 154515,
      "text": "本质上就是一场尊重笨蛋的游戏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 154920,
      "end_ms": 155800,
      "text": "你瞧不起谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 155860,
      "end_ms": 156955,
      "text": "就赚不到谁的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 157330,
      "end_ms": 159415,
      "text": "向下兼容才是财富密码，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 159720,
      "end_ms": 162895,
      "text": "能伺候好自己讨厌的人才是赚钱的最高境界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 163150,
      "end_ms": 165415,
      "text": "而有些品牌就只赚蠢人的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 165700,
      "end_ms": 167925,
      "text": "你要是鼓励一个愚蠢的人继续愚蠢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 168170,
      "end_ms": 168975,
      "text": "他会感激你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 169310,
      "end_ms": 171570,
      "text": "但是你要试图帮他走出愚蠢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 171750,
      "end_ms": 173620,
      "text": "他会恨你的尊重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 173620,
      "end_ms": 175140,
      "text": "每一只青蛙和它的景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 175400,
      "end_ms": 176944,
      "text": "不要去试图改变什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 177360,
      "end_ms": 179695,
      "text": "每个人的认知都配得上他的苦难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 180160,
      "end_ms": 182440,
      "text": "唯上至与下愚不疑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 183100,
      "end_ms": 183580,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 183720,
      "end_ms": 185320,
      "text": "你之所以受到委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 185500,
      "end_ms": 188620,
      "text": "是因为你一直在试图改变一个根本不可能改变的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 188860,
      "end_ms": 191920,
      "text": "人生最大的清醒就是允许别人愚蠢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 192060,
      "end_ms": 193540,
      "text": "但绝不允许别人的愚蠢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_34a16819ec77feb4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 193700,
      "end_ms": 194585,
      "text": "毁掉自己。"
    }
  ],
